WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.025
Write your own cycle.

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:06.507
Open Program Builder. Add a week, then add a day.

00:00:06.967 --> 00:00:13.004
Add exercises from the library. Choose sets, reps, and a percent of your record.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:17.972
Name your program and it joins the list. Preview it, then start it.

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:22.938
Barforge Weightlifting is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
